      "repair_reason": "- [P1] The code change appears mechanically sound, but the external PR needs contributor-updated current-head real behavior proof rather than an automated repair.; Cleared: The diff only adds local stdout/stderr stream error listeners and a focused test; no concrete security or supply-chain concern is visible. (sha=a23eb4efbc5a47696d6cd61ea921b2e0aca63002)",
      "review_summary": "The PR adds no-op stdout/stderr error listeners to waitForChildProcess, removes them during cleanup, and adds a regression test that emits stream errors on fake child pipes.\n\nPR surface: Source +9, Tests +16. Total +25 across 2 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. from source inspection, but not from an executed current-main repro in this read-only review. Current main attaches stdout/stderr data listeners inside waitForChildProcess without stream error listeners, and the inspected Node EventEmitter implementation throws unhandled error events when no listener is present.",
